# 必考词 Unit22
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-必考词
# 描述: 必考词Unit22核心高频词汇

{{surface}}{/ˈsɜːrfɪs/}}{n. 表面；外表}}{{The surface of the lake was calm and still.}}

{{surge}}{/sɜːrdʒ/}}{n./v. 激增；涌动}}{{There was a surge in demand for online services during the pandemic.}}

{{surplus}}{/ˈsɜːrpləs/}}{n. 剩余；adj. 过剩的}}{{The country has a trade surplus with its neighbors.}}

{{surrender}}{/səˈrendər/}}{v. 投降；放弃}}{{The army was forced to surrender after a long siege.}}

{{surround}}{/səˈraʊnd/}}{v. 包围；围绕}}{{The island is surrounded by crystal-clear water.}}

{{survey}}{/ˈsɜːrveɪ/}}{n./v. 调查；测量}}{{The survey revealed that most people support the new policy.}}

{{survive}}{/səˈvaɪv/}}{v. 幸存；挺过}}{{Only a few species survived the mass extinction event.}}

{{suspect}}{/səˈspekt/}}{v. 怀疑；n. 嫌疑人}}{{Police suspect that the fire was started deliberately.}}

{{suspend}}{/səˈspend/}}{v. 暂停；悬挂}}{{The company suspended operations due to the pandemic.}}

{{sustain}}{/səˈsteɪn/}}{v. 维持；支撑}}{{It is difficult to sustain economic growth without innovation.}}

{{symbol}}{/ˈsɪmbl/}}{n. 象征；符号}}{{The dove is a symbol of peace in many cultures.}}

{{sympathy}}{/ˈsɪmpəθi/}}{n. 同情；赞同}}{{She expressed sympathy for the victims of the disaster.}}

{{symptom}}{/ˈsɪmptəm/}}{n. 症状；征兆}}{{Fever is a common symptom of many infections.}}

{{tackle}}{/ˈtækl/}}{v. 处理；对付}}{{We must tackle the issue of climate change urgently.}}

{{target}}{/ˈtɑːrɡɪt/}}{n. 目标；v. 瞄准}}{{The company set a target of increasing sales by 20%.}}

{{task}}{/tɑːsk/}}{n. 任务；工作}}{{The task of rebuilding the city will take years.}}

{{technique}}{/tekˈniːk/}}{n. 技术；技巧}}{{The artist mastered the technique of oil painting.}}

{{temporary}}{/ˈtempərəri/}}{adj. 暂时的；临时的}}{{The arrangement is only temporary until a permanent solution is found.}}

{{tendency}}{/ˈtendənsi/}}{n. 趋势；倾向}}{{There is a tendency for prices to rise during holidays.}}

{{terminal}}{/ˈtɜːrmɪnl/}}{adj. 末期的；n. 终端；航站楼}}{{The patient was diagnosed with terminal cancer.}}

{{territory}}{/ˈterətɔːri/}}{n. 领土；领域}}{{The company expanded its territory into new markets.}}

{{theme}}{/θiːm/}}{n. 主题；题目}}{{The theme of the conference is sustainable development.}}

{{theory}}{/ˈθɪəri/}}{n. 理论；学说}}{{The theory was supported by extensive experimental data.}}

{{therapy}}{/ˈθerəpi/}}{n. 治疗；疗法}}{{Physical therapy helped him recover from the injury.}}

{{threat}}{/θret/}}{n. 威胁；恐吓}}{{Cybersecurity threats are increasing every year.}}

{{thrive}}{/θraɪv/}}{v. 繁荣；茁壮成长}}{{Small businesses can thrive in a supportive economic environment.}}

{{tolerate}}{/ˈtɒləreɪt/}}{v. 容忍；忍受}}{{She could not tolerate the noise from the construction site.}}

{{tone}}{/təʊn/}}{n. 语气；色调}}{{The tone of the letter was polite but firm.}}

{{topic}}{/ˈtɒpɪk/}}{n. 话题；主题}}{{Climate change is a热门 topic in today's news.}}

{{total}}{/ˈtəʊtl/}}{adj. 总的；n. 总数}}{{The total cost of the project exceeded the budget.}}

{{tough}}{/tʌf/}}{adj. 艰难的；坚韧的}}{{The negotiations were tough but ultimately successful.}}

{{trace}}{/treɪs/}}{v. 追踪；n. 痕迹}}{{The police traced the call to a mobile phone.}}

{{tradition}}{/trəˈdɪʃn/}}{n. 传统；惯例}}{{The festival is a tradition that dates back centuries.}}

{{transform}}{/trænsˈfɔːrm/}}{v. 转变；改造}}{{Technology has transformed the way we communicate.}}

{{transmit}}{/trænsˈmɪt/}}{v. 传输；传播}}{{The disease is transmitted through contaminated water.}}

{{transparent}}{/trænsˈpærənt/}}{adj. 透明的；公开的}}{{The government should be transparent about its spending.}}

{{transport}}{/ˈtrænspɔːrt/}}{n./v. 运输；运送}}{{Efficient transport is essential for economic development.}}

{{trap}}{/træp/}}{n. 陷阱；v. 诱捕}}{{The mouse was caught in a trap.}}

{{tremendous}}{/trɪˈmendəs/}}{adj. 巨大的；极好的}}{{The project required a tremendous amount of effort.}}

{{trend}}{/trend/}}{n. 趋势；潮流}}{{There is a growing trend toward remote working.}}
